<blockquote>
<p>Came the last night of sadness<br />
And it was clear she couldn't go on<br />
The door was open and the wind appeared<br />
The candles blew and then disappeared<br />
The curtains flew and then he appeared<br />
<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ClQcUyhoxTg">Saying don't be afraid</a></p>
</blockquote>
<p>Well, here's my second SCP! This ended up being far more ambitious than I'd originally intended, but I'm very proud of how it turned out.</p>
<p>Special thanks to:</p>
