<li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mathbrush" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2026461); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2026461&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1578947897" alt="MathBrush" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2026461)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mathbrush" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2026461); return false;">MathBrush</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1404533); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1404533&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1578947897" alt="Zyn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1404533)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1404533); return false;">Zyn</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stallmantic" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3472766); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3472766&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1578947897" alt="Stallmantic" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3472766)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stallmantic" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3472766); return false;">Stallmantic</a></span> for their amazing line-by-line critiques, as well as dealing with my neurotic ass in the first place. εїз εїз εїз Y'all are dope as hell.</li>
